{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18384","headline":"夏游招隐寺暴雨晚晴 · 李正封","name":"夏游招隐寺暴雨晚晴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹柏风雨过，萧疎台殿凉。\n石渠写奔溜，金刹照颓阳。\n鹤飞岩烟碧，鹿鸣涧草香。\n山僧引清梵，幡盖绕回廊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李正封","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}